    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d21-a4">

                <pb facs="0097" n="27" sameAs="frus:frus1867p2/pg27"/>

                <head>[Untitled]</head>
                <p>His Excellency <hi rendition="#small-caps">R. B. Van Valkenburgh,</hi>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Minister Resident of the United States of America,
                        &amp;c., &amp;c., &amp;c.:</hi></p>
                <p>We have the honor to inform your excellency that, in compliance with a desire,
                    expressed on behalf of the French government, that our nobility, like that of
                    other countries, should be represented on the occasion of the opening of the
                    international exhibition at Paris, his Majesty, the Tycoon, has resolved upon
                    sending his Highness Tokugawa Minboo Tayn, his youngest brother, to the capital
                    of France.</p>
                <p>Stated with respect and esteem,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>INOMIGE KAWATSI NO KAMI.</signed>
                    <lb/>
                    <signed>INABA MUIO NO KAMI.</signed>
                    <lb/>
                    <signed>MATSDAIRA SUWO NO KAMI.</signed>
                    <lb/>
                    <signed>OGASAWARA IKI NO KAMI.</signed>
                    <lb/>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left">
                        <date calendar="gregorian japanese-nengō" when="1867-02-09">The 5th day of
                            the 1st month of the 3d year of his Majesty, (<hi rendition="#italic"
                                >February</hi> 9, 1867.)</date>
                    </dateline>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
